/Alt (A heatmap showing the frequency of remediation strategies across genders. Females most frequently use justification \(29%\), while males most frequently use justification, accept failure, and do nothing \(16% each\). Other strategies include defensively changing the subject, fishing for reassurance, apology, aggression, humor, and more, with varying frequencies.)
